#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:1
#: 6b9f4b2aa2204dbf9848e1f25607720c
msgid "Isaac Sim"
msgstr "Isaac Sim"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:3
#: 8469ffd6199144caad132a9a3031d377
msgid "Run robot demos with NVIDIA Isaac Sim for high-fidelity simulation."
msgstr "使用 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 运行高保真仿真机器人演示。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:5
#: afbd6ab4f2144cdc81d7f1017208d5e3
msgid ""
"Use **FaSim-Isaac** `./init.sh` and `./run.sh`. Path and version live in "
"that repo’s config; CLI flags are those named in its README."
msgstr ""
"使用 **FaSim-Isaac** 的 `./init.sh` 和 `./run.sh`。路径和版本写在该仓库配置里 — 不要写死某一个 "
"Isaac 次版本号，也不要发明 CLI 参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:7
#: 66931d6727c043f5a6cd59564f26d0bd
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:9
#: 340c3a2a03264da098988baa39bb625a
msgid "NVIDIA Isaac Sim binary installed (GPU + matching NVIDIA drivers)"
msgstr "已安装 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 二进制（GPU 及匹配的 NVIDIA 驱动）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:10
#: 20dc9bddc4c8445ba6624f987c4500f2
msgid "ROS 2 Jazzy workspace"
msgstr "ROS 2 Jazzy 工作空间"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:11
#: f4b2fea5877245ccac66b105abf5fa73
msgid ""
"Default Isaac directory: `ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim` unless you override"
" it)"
msgstr "默认 Isaac 目录：`ISAACSIM_DIR`（除非覆盖，否则为 `~/isaacsim`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:13
#: d87986bb7474488d8dc0a614a309349f
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "步骤"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:15
#: 0dfb1bae4d8a470cab82c08494c34ce5
msgid "1. Clone FaSim-Isaac"
msgstr "1. 克隆 FaSim-Isaac"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:17
#: e3d189b6ccc54e9eb8e3e441e8326ce9
msgid ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:23
#: 0ca28338ca2c48d3955e0a03bc102292
msgid "2. Initialize"
msgstr "2. 初始化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:25
#: 7ed566007ada4ab89088913e29b42814
msgid "./init.sh"
msgstr "./init.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:29
#: 9821193525e44cd293902d45f92bc5ef
msgid "What the script does (FaSim README):"
msgstr "脚本做什么（FaSim README）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:31
#: 1e61390fb8c54a369017bab20e3d1a62
msgid ""
"**Operation 1** — initialize submodules listed in `.gitmodules` / "
"`submodules_visibility.conf` (`public` selected by default; `private` "
"needs access). Re-runs are additive."
msgstr ""
"**操作 1** — 初始化 `.gitmodules` / `submodules_visibility.conf` 中的子模块（默认勾选 "
"`public`；`private` 需要权限）。多次运行是追加的。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:32
#: 3758291b97074e4398481e65447fa6f0
msgid ""
"**Operation 2** — optional **Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy workspace**: version menu "
"queries GitHub stable tags (fallback list in `config/fa_sim.conf` "
"currently `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`). Override with "
"`ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh`."
msgstr ""
"**操作 2** — 可选 **Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy 工作空间**：版本菜单查询 GitHub 稳定 tag（回退列表见 "
"`config/fa_sim.conf`，目前是 `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`）。用 "
"`ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh` 覆盖。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:34
#: 85825b4f2e6f428c97ee45cf3804da9a
msgid "3. Start Isaac Sim"
msgstr "3. 启动 Isaac Sim"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:36
#: 94214ebad204421285ba8f6d19131eff
msgid "./run.sh"
msgstr "./run.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:40
#: abc228c2efcb4b978e48a4158ba34fb1
msgid ""
"What the script does: optional CPU governor, optional Zenoh router if "
"`RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`, then an interactive menu — **PhysX** "
"/ **Newton** / **Headless Streaming**. There is no `./run.sh --robot` or "
"`./run.sh --headless`."
msgstr ""
"脚本做什么：可选 CPU 调频、若 `RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` 则可选 Zenoh "
"router，然后是交互菜单 — **PhysX** / **Newton** / **Headless Streaming**。没有 "
"`./run.sh --robot` 或 `./run.sh --headless`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:42
#: 21a441e3fc7a4fb78c3cab081bd5abb3
msgid ""
"Path/version overrides: copy `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf` and set `ISAACSIM_DIR` / "
"`ISAAC_SIM_DEFAULT_VERSION`. Env also works: `ISAACSIM_DIR=/path "
"./run.sh`."
msgstr ""
"路径/版本覆盖：复制 `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf`，设置 `ISAACSIM_DIR` / "
"`ISAAC_SIM_DEFAULT_VERSION`。环境变量也可以：`ISAACSIM_DIR=/path ./run.sh`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:44
#: 54b5017363bc480685c506c65e78da42
msgid "4. Launch ROS 2 Side"
msgstr "4. 启动 ROS 2 侧"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:46
#: 3181e7b50503400b8e97e32d7ea15003
msgid "In a new terminal:"
msgstr "在新终端中："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:48
#: 25e0cd2084b24129835fccba35e74a6f
msgid ""
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=isaac"
msgstr ""
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=isaac"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:53
#: e758daec3e074598bb60a0533e212ae3
msgid ""
"Pass `robot:=…` on this ROS 2 launch as usual. Robot USD selection is "
"done by opening the asset under FaSim `robots/` (robot_usds) in Isaac — "
"not a FaSim `run.sh` flag."
msgstr ""
"照常在这条 ROS 2 launch 上传 `robot:=…`。机器人 USD 是在 Isaac 里打开 FaSim "
"`robots/`（robot_usds）下的资产 — 不是 FaSim `run.sh` 的参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:55
#: 0c2955412180444282d6951d90b1a155
msgid "5. Verify Connection"
msgstr "5. 验证连接"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:57
#: e2a351facf7a4fe18cde7403e08bceb5
msgid "ros2 topic list"
msgstr "ros2 topic list"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:61
#: 859aee4c6d0d4b79bddf6ce8c362fd0f
msgid ""
"Acone `hardware:=isaac` uses `topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem` "
"with `/isaac/joint_command` and `/isaac/joint_states` "
"([xacro](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"arx/blob/main/arx_acone_description/xacro/ros2_control/robot.xacro)). Do "
"not expect a stack-wide `/target_pose`."
msgstr ""
"Acone 的 `hardware:=isaac` 使用 "
"`topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`，话题为 `/isaac/joint_command` 和 "
"`/isaac/joint_states`（[xacro](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"arx/blob/main/arx_acone_description/xacro/ros2_control/robot.xacro)）。不要期待全栈通用的"
" `/target_pose`。"

