#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:87
#: 6f3ec006408b4576bef3c49991aafa48
msgid ""
"The `hardware:=isaac` parameter uses the topic-based 硬件接口 that bridges "
"Isaac Sim physics to ROS 2 control. Plugin `<param>` names "
"(`joint_commands_topic`, `initialize_commands_from_state`, …): [Hardware "
"Interface parameters](../../4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md)."
msgstr ""
"`hardware:=isaac` 使用基于话题的**硬件接口**，把 Isaac Sim 物理桥接到 ROS 2 control。插件 "
"`<param>` 名称（`joint_commands_topic`、`initialize_commands_from_state` "
"等）：[硬件接口参数](../../4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md)。"

